fatx (1.15) unstable; urgency=low

  corrected false detection of directories not closed
  corrected finding invalid entries instead of deleted entries
  corrected incorrect management of bad characters in file names
  corrected bug related to datestamps
  corrected bugs when used with splice
  corrected bugs in reading buffer
  disabled use of fuse handler

 -- Christophe Duverger <fatx@christopheduverger.fr>  Fri, 16 Feb 2018 09:01:28 +0100

fatx (1.14) unstable; urgency=low

  corrected interactions (answers where not correctly taken into account)
  corrected freeing fat clusters during fsck
  corrected splice transfers
  added capacity to manage changes on a separate file
  added detection of clusters sharing between entries
  reduced memory leaks
  reduced multithreading conflicts
  improved accuracy of fsck choices in case of duplicate reference
  added capacity to handle parallel tests
  added complementary tests for fsck

 -- Christophe Duverger <fatx@christopheduverger.fr>  Mon, 16 Jan 2017 20:28:32 +0100

